{
  "description": "Shared Backend <-> ML conformance cases. target_selection: Contract docs 5.1 (earliest planned action in (T+10m, T+15m]; several actions at that earliest time -> ambiguous unless all are identical in time, geometry and manual_fill, i.e. identical model inputs, which collapse to the lowest numeric id as a trace-only identifier).",
  "target_selection": [
    {"name": "earliest action in horizon", "T": "2026-01-06T03:35:00Z", "rows": [
